Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.96,Main,koji,0,0,0,,If I may, I'd like to pose this question:
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.83,Main,koji,0,0,0,,Are human beings truly equal?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.71,0:00:26.17,Main,koji,0,0,0,,Nowadays, people never shut up about the need for equality.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.01,0:00:33.72,Main,koji,0,0,0,,A great man once said, "Heaven does not create one person above or below another."
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.81,0:00:36.81,Main,koji,0,0,0,,But the quote doesn't end there.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.90,Main,koji,0,0,0,,It actually says we're equal at birth,\Nbut then gaps appear.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.90,0:00:47.24,Main,koji,0,0,0,,That the differences are the result of one's academic efforts, or lack thereof.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.41,Main,koji,0,0,0,,At any rate, humans are capable of thinking for themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.16,0:00:57.25,Main,koji,0,0,0,,"Equality" may be a false concept,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.25,0:01:01.67,Main,koji,0,0,0,,but our inequality remains a difficult thing to accept.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.83,0:01:06.34,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Excuse me... Could you give up your seat?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.51,0:01:13.26,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,That's a priority seat. I think you should let this elderly lady sit there.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.01,0:01:16.60,Main,taka,0,0,0,,My, my, pretty girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.60,0:01:21.89,Main,taka,0,0,0,,While it may be a priority seat, there is no law requiring me to relinquish it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.52,Main,taka,0,0,0,,You want me to give up my seat just because I am young?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.77,0:01:28.03,Main,taka,0,0,0,,Nonsense, pure and simple.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.03,0:01:33.07,Main,taka,0,0,0,,Even if I am young, standing consumes more stamina than sitting.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.07,0:01:37.29,Main,taka,0,0,0,,Why should I do something so detrimental with no benefit to myself?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.29,0:01:41.00,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I think you'd be contributing to society.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.00,0:01:44.29,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,And this lady seems to be having trouble staying upright.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.29,0:01:47.55,Main,taka,0,0,0,,I have no interest in contributing to society.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.42,0:01:49.80,Main,taka,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.13,0:01:53.68,Main,taka,0,0,0,,What about those sitting in the other seats?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.09,0:01:59.56,Main,taka,0,0,0,,The difference between priority seats and others seems rather trivial to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.18,0:02:04.06,Main,woman,0,0,0,,R-Really, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.27,Main,woman,0,0,0,,But thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.19,0:02:13.49,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Would any of you be willing to give up your seat?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.58,Main,woman,0,0,0,,Um, you can have mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.58,0:02:24.83,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.86,0:02:50.27,Main,aya,0,0,0,,So this is my new school?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.16,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Tokyo Metropolitan Advanced Nurturing High School.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.66,Main,aya,0,0,0,,A school established by the Japanese government
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.66,0:03:02.66,Main,aya,0,0,0,,to nurture the young people who will support the country in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.37,0:03:07.08,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It boasts a 100% employment and college entry rate,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.50,Main,aya,0,0,0,,and with thorough, state-directed teaching methods,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.88,Main,aya,0,0,0,,it spares no effort in pursuing the nation's desired future.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.88,0:03:13.88,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.09,0:03:20.89,Main,hori,0,0,0,,You were looking at me on the bus. Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.60,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Oh. Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.06,0:03:29.15,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It was because you, like me, didn't seem interested in giving up your seat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.61,0:03:32.40,Main,aya,0,0,0,,So you don't like to get involved in stuff like that either, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.11,0:03:34.61,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Don't assume I'm like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.07,0:03:38.16,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I held on to my seat as a matter of conviction.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.16,0:03:41.16,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Uh, doesn't that make you even worse?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.53,0:03:43.16,Main,hori,0,0,0,,If you have no business with me, fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.46,0:03:53.92,Main,hashi,0,0,0,,Now we'll have a few words from the student council president.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.68,Main,mana,0,0,0,,I am the student council president, Horikita Manabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.05,0:04:02.97,Main,mana,0,0,0,,As a representative of the upper classes,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.97,0:04:07.48,Main,mana,0,0,0,,I would like to extend words of welcome to our newest students.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.60,0:04:13.98,Main,mana,0,0,0,,As I believe you know, our school is highly accomplished in all aspects,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.98,0:04:17.95,Main,mana,0,0,0,,and boasts a high employment and college entry rate.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.95,0:04:21.20,Main,mana,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the pride of our school, accomplished through the hard work
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.20,0:04:25.20,Main,mana,0,0,0,,{\an8}of both our graduating students and those still attending.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.58,0:04:29.29,Top,mana,0,0,0,,We expect the same from the new students.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.21,0:04:30.08,Main,aya,0,0,0,,We're in the same class?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.21,Top,mana,0,0,0,,Everything in this school is decided by merit...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.67,0:04:38.80,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I see! What genre do you like best?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.80,0:04:43.26,Main,girl,0,0,0,,Oh, what genre? Well... I like romance!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.60,Main,girl,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.97,0:04:45.56,Top,girl,0,0,0,,Stuff like shoujo manga...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.26,0:04:48.14,Main,girl,0,0,0,,Really? I like mysteries!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.14,0:04:48.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Mysteries?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.94,0:04:49.73,Main,girl,0,0,0,,Surprising, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.73,0:04:50.19,Main,girl,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.52,0:04:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I get that a lot!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.69,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm sitting next to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.90,Main,hori,0,0,0,,An unpleasant coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.90,0:04:57.24,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.24,0:04:59.82,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Everyone, may I have a moment?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.82,0:05:02.62,Main,hira,0,0,0,,I was hoping we could all introduce ourselves
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.62,0:05:06.45,Main,hira,0,0,0,,to get a jump on getting better acquainted.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.83,0:05:09.46,Main,hira,0,0,0,,The teacher doesn't seem to be here yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.46,0:05:10.21,Main,hira,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.21,0:05:11.46,Main,girl,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.96,Main,karu,0,0,0,,Sounds fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.96,0:05:16.34,Main,sato,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't even know anyone's names.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.67,0:05:20.13,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Thanks. Okay, I'll go first.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.13,0:05:21.80,Main,hira,0,0,0,,I'm Hirata Yosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.84,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Just call me Yosuke. No need for formality.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.22,0:05:29.60,Main,hira,0,0,0,,I play all kinds of sports, and I intend to join the soccer club at this school.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.14,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you all!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.31,Main,all,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sounds good!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.81,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I bet he'll end up being the class leader.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.81,0:05:37.36,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I'll go next!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.73,0:05:40.24,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,My name is Kushida Kikyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.24,0:05:43.95,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,My goal is to become friends with each and every one of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.95,0:05:49.12,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I'd like to make lots of good memories,\Nso don't hesitate to invite me anywhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.37,Main,all,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.92,Main,aya,0,0,0,,She'll be popular with both guys and girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.46,Main,ike,0,0,0,,{\an8}Me next! I'm Ike Kanji!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.42,0:05:57.80,Main,aya,0,0,0,,She's already got that "I can be friends with anyone" aura about her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.46,0:05:58.75,Main,ike,0,0,0,,{\an8}I love girls, and I hate hot guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.17,Main,aya,0,0,0,,But I guess this is no time to be critical.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.75,0:06:02.38,Main,ike,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm always accepting new girlfriend applications!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.38,0:06:06.43,Main,aya,0,0,0,,These introductions will determine everyone's standing in the class.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.85,Main,yama,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm Yamauchi Haruki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.10,Main,yama,0,0,0,,{\an8}In elementary school, I went to nationals in ping-pong.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.76,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Should I try for a joke?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.10,0:06:10.89,Main,yama,0,0,0,,{\an8}In middle school, I was the baseball club's ace and cleanup hitter.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.35,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I bet I can get a big laugh if I'm really energetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.89,0:06:13.89,Main,yama,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm still recovering from an injury I got during the Inter-high.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.31,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'd just creep everyone out.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.89,0:06:16.73,Main,boys,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, wow! The Inter-high, in middle school?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.73,0:06:19.32,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It's not like I have any hobbies or talents, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.07,0:06:23.49,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm just a white bird, flying free.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.49,0:06:26.41,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Next up... you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.66,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.71,Main,aya,0,0,0,,No getting around it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.71,0:06:38.75,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'd better muster up the energy to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.75,0:06:40.42,Main,aya,0,0,0,,For the sake of my school life.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.30,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.30,0:06:44.93,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.93,0:06:47.01,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm Ayanokoji Kiyotaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.01,0:06:47.97,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.31,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I look forward to studying with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.35,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.02,0:06:56.65,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm not good at anything in particular.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.44,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.44,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'll work hard to get along with everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.45,0:07:07.28,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I blew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.45,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.20,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Let's be good friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.83,Main,aya,0,0,0,,She laughed at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.83,0:07:17.96,Main,hira,0,0,0,,Okay, next up...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.67,0:07:21.71,Main,sumi,0,0,0,,Introductions? Please.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.34,Main,sumi,0,0,0,,What are we, little kids?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.71,0:07:25.88,Main,sumi,0,0,0,,Do that if you want, but leave us out of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.47,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.55,0:07:29.72,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Take your seats.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.72,0:07:37.52,Main,cha,0,0,0,,I'm Chabashira Sae,\Nthe homeroom teacher for Class D.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.23,0:07:40.86,Main,cha,0,0,0,,There will be no changing of classes in this school.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.86,0:07:45.07,Main,cha,0,0,0,,I will be responsible for you for the next three years, until you graduate.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.28,0:07:49.24,Main,cha,0,0,0,,First, I'll hand out the school rule book.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.70,0:07:51.83,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Take one and pass it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.46,Main,cha,0,0,0,,We have special rules at this school.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.25,0:07:59.29,Main,cha,0,0,0,,First, you will live in dorms.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.29,0:08:05.01,Main,cha,0,0,0,,While at school, your ability to leave campus and contact the outside world will be limited.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.01,0:08:07.26,Main,cha,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.26,0:08:10.14,Main,cha,0,0,0,,The school offers a variety of facilities.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.51,0:08:16.27,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Everything you need can be found here, including entertainment.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.77,0:08:21.27,Main,cha,0,0,0,,To buy things, you'll use points stored in the school's official computer system.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.61,0:08:25.53,Main,cha,0,0,0,,At this school, you can buy anything using points.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.11,0:08:29.07,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Points are allotted on the first of each month.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.28,Main,cha,0,0,0,,One point is worth one yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.95,0:08:37.04,Main,cha,0,0,0,,You have already been allotted 100,000 points for this month.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.16,Main,yama,0,0,0,,100,000?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.67,Main,ike,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.29,0:08:44.13,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Are you surprised by the size of your allotment?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.30,Main,cha,0,0,0,,This school judges students based on merit.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.30,0:08:53.80,Main,cha,0,0,0,,You are attributed significant value just for being accepted here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.18,Main,woman,0,0,0,,Thanks for your business!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.85,0:09:01.56,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It really does work like money.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.56,0:09:06.11,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Twenty-five students per class, and four classes per grade...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.11,0:09:08.03,Main,aya,0,0,0,,That makes 300 students total.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.49,0:09:11.45,Main,aya,0,0,0,,If each student gets 100,000 yen per month,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.45,0:09:14.33,Main,aya,0,0,0,,that's 360 million per year.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.33,0:09:17.04,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Strange, even if it is government-funded...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.75,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Another unpleasant coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.84,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so twitchy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.26,0:09:31.76,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Well, since we sit beside each other, we should at least get along.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.34,0:09:33.34,Main,aya,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.64,0:09:39.56,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You can tell me that much, can't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.73,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Is it a problem if I refuse to answer?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.73,0:09:46.57,Main,aya,0,0,0,,No, but it's unsettling not to know the name of the person sitting beside me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.78,Main,hori,0,0,0,,It's Horikita Suzune.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.61,0:09:54.20,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Horikita?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.70,0:09:56.12,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Like the student council president?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.87,0:10:03.04,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You're buying lots of cheap stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.38,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You have a lot of money, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.38,0:10:07.00,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You could buy more expensive—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.00,Top,hori,0,0,0,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.00,Main,aya,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.00,0:10:10.38,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I don't need it, I told you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.13,0:10:11.97,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.51,0:10:16.47,Main,hori,0,0,0,,You don't seem very good at interacting with people.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.47,0:10:18.26,Main,hori,0,0,0,,You're a lousy conversationalist.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.26,0:10:22.31,Main,aya,0,0,0,,That's true, although you don't seem much better.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.31,0:10:28.27,Main,hori,0,0,0,,True. But I, for one, feel no need to make friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.94,0:10:30.36,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Free?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.36,0:10:34.66,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I guess it's to help people who use up their points?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.66,0:10:37.28,Main,hori,0,0,0,,On top of 100,000 yen a month?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.28,0:10:38.95,Main,hori,0,0,0,,This school is quite indulgent.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.54,Top,sugi,0,0,0,,You looking down on me? Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.54,Main,boy,0,0,0,,You're in Class 1-D, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.54,0:10:46.04,Main,sugi,0,0,0,,And what if I am?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.04,0:10:51.05,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Now, that's no way to talk to your seniors.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.30,Main,sugi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.38,0:10:52.30,Top,aya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.47,Main,aya,0,0,0,,He's from our class, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.17,Main,boy,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't care if you're my seniors!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.17,0:10:56.05,Main,boy,0,0,0,,{\an8}You want to fight or not?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.47,0:10:57.55,Main,hori,0,0,0,,My integrity would take a dive if I involved myself in that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.05,0:10:58.01,Main,boy,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll take all three of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.56,Main,sugi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bring it on!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.35,Main,boy,0,0,0,,We'll let you off easy today.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.35,0:11:04.18,Main,boy,0,0,0,,You guys are already defective losers.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.18,0:11:06.65,Main,boy,0,0,0,,If we knocked you any lower, you'd just be pathetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.27,Main,sugi,0,0,0,,Are you running away?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.27,0:11:09.61,Main,boy,0,0,0,,Scream all you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.82,Main,boy,0,0,0,,The real hell is yet to come for you people, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.07,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Hell?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.49,0:11:17.16,Main,sugi,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.22,0:11:43.72,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It wasn't long before groups began to form within the class.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.98,Main,mi,0,0,0,,Kikyo, let's get lunch together!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.98,0:11:48.98,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Sorry, I've got some things to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.27,0:11:54.57,Main,gai,0,0,0,,'Twas a mere 80,000! We're to receive 100,000 every month, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.57,0:11:57.53,Main,ike,0,0,0,,I bought tons of mobile games!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.53,0:12:00.99,Main,yama,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sounds good! I'll buy some, too, and we can battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.57,0:11:59.70,Main,matsu,0,0,0,,I saw this accessory I really liked.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.70,0:12:00.99,Main,karu,0,0,0,,Want to stop by after class?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.99,0:12:03.33,Main,karu,0,0,0,,I wanna buy clothes, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.33,0:12:05.70,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I failed at making friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.58,Main,hori,0,0,0,,You're pitiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.71,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You're alone, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.71,0:12:14.80,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Yes, because I like to be alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.43,0:12:21.47,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll hit up the cafeteria...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.31,0:12:26.48,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Um... Ayanokoji, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.77,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Yeah. Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.85,0:12:30.85,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Kushida?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.23,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.23,0:12:34.48,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you remembered my name!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.99,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Yeah... I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.99,0:12:40.66,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Um... Can we talk?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.29,0:12:52.08,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji, you seem very close to Horikita.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.08,0:12:54.75,Main,aya,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't say that...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.75,0:12:59.51,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,But you're the only one she ever talks to.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.51,0:13:04.10,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with everyone in school.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.10,0:13:08.02,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,So I asked Horikita for her contact information,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.02,0:13:09.60,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,but she turned me down...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.23,0:13:12.77,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,She said she doesn't want to be friends with anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.11,0:13:15.23,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think that's just how she is.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.23,0:13:18.90,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,But I want to be friends with Horikita, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.78,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Won't you help me?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.28,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Help you? I don't...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.28,0:13:26.04,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,You... won't?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.54,0:13:32.04,Main,cha,0,0,0,,The head of the Yamato government was known as the "o-kimi."
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.04,0:13:36.80,Main,cha,0,0,0,,He controlled the powerful families of each region using the uji-kabane system.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.80,0:13:40.80,Main,cha,0,0,0,,"Uji" referred to groups that shared the same bloodline,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.80,0:13:43.26,Main,cha,0,0,0,,while "kabane" referred to post and status.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.26,0:13:47.56,Main,cha,0,0,0,,In other words, it was a system where bloodline determined one's post and status.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.10,0:13:50.31,Main,cha,0,0,0,,That's all for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.77,0:13:53.06,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Please review the material thoroughly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.20,Main,hori,0,0,0,,This school really is indulgent.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.08,0:14:10.95,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Students play around and nap in class, but the teacher never calls them out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.95,0:14:14.71,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Is this really an advanced school run by the government?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.71,0:14:18.46,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Maybe they want to encourage student autonomy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.71,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.05,0:14:26.22,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Hey. If you're on your way out,\Nwould you come with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.43,0:14:28.97,Main,hori,0,0,0,,What are you after?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.97,0:14:32.73,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Does an invitation from me suggest an ulterior motive?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.73,0:14:36.65,Main,hori,0,0,0,,If you'll tell me specifically what you want,\NI'd be willing to hear you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.69,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You know that café in the mall, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.36,Main,aya,0,0,0,,The one where lots of girls hang out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.61,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Would you go there with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.62,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.08,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm not brave enough to go by myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.00,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It feels sort of "no boys allowed."
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.54,0:14:56.63,Main,hori,0,0,0,,And there's no one else you can ask? No, I suppose not...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.63,0:14:59.75,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It pains me to say it, but you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.81,Main,hori,0,0,0,,It's quite crowded.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.85,Main,aya,0,0,0,,So this is your first time coming here, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.85,0:15:19.06,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Ah, right. You're a loner.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.53,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Was that a dig? You child.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.44,Main,aya,0,0,0,,That table's free.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.70,0:15:32.79,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You know, I wonder if we look like a couple to the oth—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.42,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably not.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.42,0:15:41.46,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Thinking of what's about to happen is making my stomach hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.79,0:15:40.79,Main,mi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ready to go?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.79,0:15:41.46,Main,i,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.09,0:15:44.55,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Horikita!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.30,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.84,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,You, too, Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.26,0:15:50.43,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Do you two come here often?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.43,0:15:52.51,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Today's our first time.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.51,0:15:53.60,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.60,0:15:54.77,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I'm here alone—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.77,0:15:55.52,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.39,0:15:59.02,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Hey, we only just got here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.02,0:16:02.77,Main,hori,0,0,0,,If Kushida is here, you don't need me, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.77,0:16:07.03,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Well... Kushida and I are just classmates.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.03,0:16:09.78,Main,hori,0,0,0,,That's all you and I are, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.78,0:16:10.78,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.58,0:16:14.79,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I don't like this. What are you after?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.79,0:16:18.04,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,C-Come on, it was just a coincidence...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.04,0:16:22.79,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Kushida, you should have said,\N"What's that supposed to mean?"
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.79,0:16:26.88,Main,hori,0,0,0,,The girls who were sitting here,\Nand the two at the next table over,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.80,Main,hori,0,0,0,,were all students from Class D.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.51,0:16:30.55,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Coincidence?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.47,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you recognized them.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.47,0:16:34.56,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.89,0:16:38.06,Main,hori,0,0,0,,We came here right after class ended,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.06,0:16:42.81,Main,hori,0,0,0,,which means they could only have been in this café for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.81,0:16:44.78,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Too soon for them to be leaving.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.82,0:16:47.65,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.24,0:16:53.08,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. We set you up.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.41,Main,kita,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.91,0:16:58.58,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Horikita! Please be my friend!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.83,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I want you to leave me alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.83,0:17:04.34,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I won't trouble the class.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.50,0:17:09.34,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,But you'll be lonely all by yourself...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.34,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I have never once felt lonely by myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.51,0:17:15.14,Main,hori,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.72,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Every word that comes out of your mouth disgusts me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.72,0:17:20.02,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.52,0:17:25.86,Main,aya,0,0,0,,If you won't be friends with anyone, you'll be alone for the next three years.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.19,0:17:29.03,Main,hori,0,0,0,,I've been alone for the last nine years, so I don't mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.36,Main,hori,0,0,0,,Longer, if you include kindergarten.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.03,0:17:39.71,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Sorry. I might have made Horikita hate you...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.71,0:17:42.12,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Nah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.25,0:17:46.46,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Maybe I can never be her friend...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.47,0:17:53.30,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,If I can't even make friends with my own classmates,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.30,0:17:55.64,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I guess my goal is still far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.64,0:17:58.31,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I think Horikita's an exception, personally...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.68,Main,girl,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your hair is always so silky!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.10,0:18:01.14,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Ichinose!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.68,0:18:01.14,Main,ichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}You think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.14,0:18:03.48,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Ichinose Honami from Class B.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.48,0:18:05.40,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,We became friends yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.65,0:18:10.53,Main,aya,0,0,0,,You're even friends with students in other classes?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.53,0:18:14.41,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Yeah! There are a lot of nice people in Class B.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.99,0:18:18.16,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Hey, this school is pretty amazing, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.16,0:18:22.16,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,There are so many stores, and we get 100,000 yen each month...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.66,0:18:26.67,Main,aya,0,0,0,,That amount seems a bit excessive to me, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.67,0:18:29.21,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Yeah... You think so, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.67,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,And calling them points makes me spend them without thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.93,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,It really messes with my sense of money.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.14,0:18:42.31,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I want to be really careful not to over-spend.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.31,0:18:45.02,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,I'll buy the things I have to, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.98,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Daily necessities like soap and detergent...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.44,0:18:50.65,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Underwear, and stuff...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.07,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Yeah, Horikita was doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.07,0:18:56.41,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.41,0:19:00.20,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,So you know how Horikita spends her money?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.08,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,You really are close, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.66,Main,aya,0,0,0,,I just happened to see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.66,0:19:07.17,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Um, she's really close...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.67,Main,kushi,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just leave it at that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.67,0:19:18.18,Main,aya,0,0,0,,It really is true, though...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.86,Main,aya,0,0,0,,100,000 per month, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.53,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Most students decided to make the most of their school lives,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.53,0:19:40.95,Main,aya,0,0,0,,without thinking too deeply about anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.70,0:19:46.83,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Day after day, they blew through their monthly allowance of 100,000 like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.79,0:19:51.04,Main,aya,0,0,0,,The teacher was very lenient,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.88,Main,aya,0,0,0,,so in-class conversations, napping, tardiness, and absences became a daily occurrence.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.47,0:20:00.22,Main,aya,0,0,0,,Extravagance, debauchery, and indolence were rampant.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.80,0:20:04.22,Main,aya,0,0,0,,And then, May 1st arrived.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.23,Main,sa,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.98,Main,ike,0,0,0,,Really? You, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.61,Main,karu,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.44,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Take your seats.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.90,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Morning homeroom will now begin.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.20,0:20:24.33,Main,yama,0,0,0,,Hey, teacher, we didn't get our points!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.33,0:20:27.62,Main,yama,0,0,0,,We're supposed to get them on the first day of the month, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.00,0:20:32.38,Main,cha,0,0,0,,No, this month's points have already been allotted.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.13,Main,yama,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.13,0:20:37.80,Main,cha,0,0,0,,The points have been allotted.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.30,Main,cha,0,0,0,,I can say that for certain.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.89,0:20:43.64,Main,cha,0,0,0,,There is no chance that this class has been overlooked, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.64,0:20:46.89,Main,ike,0,0,0,,But we didn't get any points!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.89,0:20:49.64,Main,all,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.10,0:20:55.03,Main,cha,0,0,0,,What a bunch of idiots you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.53,0:20:59.99,Main,cha,0,0,0,,A combined total of 98 tardies and absences.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.53,0:21:05.91,Main,cha,0,0,0,,391 instances of talking and cell phone usage in class.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.91,0:21:09.04,Main,cha,0,0,0,,Quite a month's work.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.04,0:21:12.67,Main,cha,0,0,0,,At this school, your grades and performance evaluations
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.67,0:21:15.63,Main,cha,0,0,0,,are reflected in the monthly points you're given.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.30,0:21:17.92,Main,cha,0,0,0,,My assessment of you
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.92,0:21:22.39,Main,cha,0,0,0,,has resulted in the loss of all 100,000 points you were to be given.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.68,Main,cha,0,0,0,,The points you're receiving for this month...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.81,Main,cha,0,0,0,,are zero.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.39,0:21:31.56,Main,ike,0,0,0,,You mean I have to live on no money this month?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.56,0:21:34.31,Main,yama,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.40,Main,yama,0,0,0,,No one told us that...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.07,0:21:40.07,Main,chi,0,0,0,,Did you really think that mere high school students
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.07,0:21:46.83,Main,chi,0,0,0,,were going to be given 100,000 yen a month to spend without a single catch?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.54,Main,chi,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.83,Main,chi,0,0,0,,Use your common sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.16,0:21:55.34,Main,chi,0,0,0,,If you had doubts, why did you do nothing about them?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.84,0:21:59.30,Main,chi,0,0,0,,I told you on the first day, didn't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.92,0:22:04.47,Main,chi,0,0,0,,This school judges students based on merit.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.55,0:22:09.06,Main,chi,0,0,0,,Which means you're all worth nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.23,0:22:12.06,Main,chi,0,0,0,,You're garbage.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,sign,0,0,0,,
